b2-0067,dq04_en,dq04_en,dq04_en: sum of the column 1 duty rate and the reciprocal rate for Korea will be 15 percent,"c1: For goods of Korea with a column 1 duty rate below 15 percent, the column 1 rate plus the additional rate under Executive Order 14257, as amended, is 15 percent. | c2: For goods of Korea with a column 1 duty rate of at least 15 percent, the additional rate under Executive Order 14257, as amended, is zero percent.",hts22:chapter_99,data/extracted/hts_pdf/chapter_99/page_0201.txt,2026HTSRev22,201,99-III-29,170bc8a2864b2033,source: hts22:chapter_99 | revision: 2026HTSRev22 | page: 201/99-III-29,"for which the column 1 duty rate is 15 percent or higher, heading 9903.02.82 applies, and no additional duty is due pursuant to heading 9903.02.83. As provided in headings 9903.02.87 and 9903.02.88, for articles the product of Liechtenstein for which the MFN tariff rate (column 1-General) is less than 15 percent, the sum of the column 1 duty rate and the additional ad valorem rate of duty pursuant to heading 9903.02.88 will be 15 percent ad valorem, and for articles the product of Liechtenstein for which the column 1 duty rate is 15 percent or higher, heading 9903.02.87 applies, and no additional duty is due pursuant to heading 9903.02.88. Harmonized Tariff Schedule of the United States Revision 22 (2026) Annotated",dfaac689fdbb6395a0ca8576f2b85f6c139ef4860fb166523067d9f519d1d854,534f363c20d410400f30cfe4a6cbb7e0660c48f3b84f9853199dcf012beed6d2,,,,,,,new
b2-0068,dq04_en,dq04_en,dq04_en: sum of the column 1 duty rate and the reciprocal rate for Korea will be 15 percent,"c1: For goods of Korea with a column 1 duty rate below 15 percent, the column 1 rate plus the additional rate under Executive Order 14257, as amended, is 15 percent. | c2: For goods of Korea with a column 1 duty rate of at least 15 percent, the additional rate under Executive Order 14257, as amended, is zero percent.",hts22:chapter_99,data/extracted/hts_pdf/chapter_99/page_0543.txt,2026HTSRev22,543,99-III-371,32c3e357099761a8,source: hts22:chapter_99 | revision: 2026HTSRev22 | page: 543/99-III-371 | note: 43,"of this note if substantially all the critical components and technology are the product of the United States, Japan, the Republic of Korea, Taiwan, Switzerland, Liechtenstein, a member nation of the European Union or the United Kingdom. Heading 9903.08.23 applies to such articles that are the product of the United Kingdom. Heading 9903.08.24 applies to such articles that are the product of Japan, Liechtenstein, South Korea, Switzerland, Taiwan or of a member nation of the European Union. For articles provided for in heading 9903.08.24 with a column 1 rate of duty of less than 15 percent, the sum of the column 1 rate of duty and the additional ad valorem rate of duty pursuant to heading 9903.08.24 will total 15",dfaac689fdbb6395a0ca8576f2b85f6c139ef4860fb166523067d9f519d1d854,2a6e3b768438b139669151ced0e87bdc7c9b3f2cd5522dd3930ce5a120ccdf6c,,,,,,,new
b2-0069,dq04_ko,dq04_ko,dq04_ko: 한미 합의 기본세율과 상호관세 합계 15%,"c1: For goods of Korea with a column 1 duty rate below 15 percent, the column 1 rate plus the additional rate under Executive Order 14257, as amended, is 15 percent. | c2: For goods of Korea with a column 1 duty rate of at least 15 percent, the additional rate under Executive Order 14257, as amended, is zero percent.",fr:2025-21940,data/extracted/fr_text/2025-21940.txt,,,,179d8f02decc7adf,source: fr:2025-21940 | document: Notice | title: Implementing Certain Tariff-Related Elements of the U.S.-Korea Strategic Trade and Investment Deal | published: 2025-12-04,"President Lee declared a new chapter in the U.S.-ROK Alliance, the linchpin for peace, security, and prosperity on the Korean Peninsula and in the Indo-Pacific region. The Joint Fact Sheet sets out steps the United States and the ROK will take to further the U.S.-ROK Alliance under the U.S.-ROK Deal. The U.S.-ROK Deal provides that, for goods of the ROK with a column 1 duty rate in the HTSUS that is less than 15 percent, the sum of the column 1 duty rate and the additional ad valorem rate of duty pursuant to Executive Order 14257, as amended, will be 15 percent. For ROK goods with a column 1 duty rate that is at least 15 percent, the additional ad",dfaac689fdbb6395a0ca8576f2b85f6c139ef4860fb166523067d9f519d1d854,f5cb5dbe5f09bafbbef0059c9245506d13d616cda6c8f86692d316ca101ff2dc,,,,,,,new
b2-0070,dq04_ko,dq04_ko,dq04_ko: 한미 합의 기본세율과 상호관세 합계 15%,"c1: For goods of Korea with a column 1 duty rate below 15 percent, the column 1 rate plus the additional rate under Executive Order 14257, as amended, is 15 percent. | c2: For goods of Korea with a column 1 duty rate of at least 15 percent, the additional rate under Executive Order 14257, as amended, is zero percent.",fr:2025-21940,data/extracted/fr_text/2025-21940.txt,,,,79d42259d71e4d5b,source: fr:2025-21940 | document: Notice | title: Implementing Certain Tariff-Related Elements of the U.S.-Korea Strategic Trade and Investment Deal | published: 2025-12-04,"duty pursuant to Executive Order 14257, as amended, will be 15 percent. For ROK goods with a column 1 duty rate that is at least 15 percent, the additional ad valorem rate of duty pursuant to Executive Order 14257, as amended, will be zero percent. The U.S.-ROK Deal also provides that for timber, lumber, and their derivative products of the ROK with a column 1 duty rate less than 15 percent, the sum of the good's column 1 duty rate and the ad valorem rate of duty pursuant to Proclamation 10976 of September 29, 2025 (Adjusting Imports of Timber, Lumber, and Their Derivative Products Into the United States) will be 15 percent ad valorem and that for such ROK goods",dfaac689fdbb6395a0ca8576f2b85f6c139ef4860fb166523067d9f519d1d854,b6e7974370ddca00d8610375dc9105ff6559c756af5cf9f6dce66e1b8eabd3ca,,,,,,,new
